---
description: Keep LMS HTML templates short and easy to edit.
globs: "templates/**/*.html"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Simple templates

- Extend `base.html` or the admin/employee layout. No extra template tags modules.
- Tables, cards, Bootstrap classes. No JS frameworks.
- Do not put role logic in templates (`user.role == "admin"`). Pass a simple flag from the view if needed.
- Logo / site name is **LMS** only.
